ta-start=\"817\" data-end=\"827\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart / Zilver<br data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"845\"><strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"855\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"928\">📦 <strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"890\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"893\">Emporio Armani AR11360 Herenhorloge</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"987\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"952\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"955\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>",
